+## `ctx.fabricTools` — `FabricToolsService`
+
+Cooperative Mod-facing tool registry API.
+
+Every registration returns the exact disposer of the underlying registry or `ctx.on()` effect and keeps the authoritative owner's ordering, cancellation, and disposal semantics. The service never stores a parallel copy of tool state.
+
+```ts cordis-catalog
+/**
+ * Register one tool through the authoritative registry.
+ * @param definition - tool schema, execution, and optional finalization/presentation callbacks.
+ * @returns the exact disposer that unregisters the tool.
